  "bodyHash": "7d1dfbd620794a6d",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faliens-untapped\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth 版本 &gt;</a></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59cee715a2af418d244c5472021889b8ded082ad.png\" alt=\"alien_banner\"></p>\n<h1><strong>內容</strong></h1>\n<p>此擴充套件包預計將加入劇中較少使用或潛力未被充分發掘的外星英雄！</p>\n<h1><strong>獲取方式</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>Merlinisapien：</strong></p>\n<h3>方法</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><p>取得一把感應用的<strong>山羊角</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b9d74bdcc90f284b46104e6805cac59c077abb37.png\" alt=\"horn\"></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>找到<strong>外星監獄</strong>並使用山羊角</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1778de4a7a4e9f94c1134a5706073769e0f27303_0.webp\" alt=\"alien prison\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>當感覺到存在感時，環顧四周尋找正在注視你的東西，並<strong>回瞪對方</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/30382e344a98ab91ef12e06c091a56dec101f3d4.png\" alt=\"feel\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c40b655a6c9c6bd4e8aa242a4867ebfcc440ca0e_0.webp\" alt=\"stalker\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>注視它們<strong>3</strong>次後，它們會蜕下一部分皮膚，你可以掃描並用於合成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/580d6680edb3e3102bd8e531f60917e91dee56ed.png\" alt=\"skin\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>右鍵點擊皮膚以解鎖<strong>Merlinisapien</strong>的變身</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d645d7792170e4dd908962793cd2c0df3405061d.png\" alt=\"scanned\"></p>\n<p><strong>Oryctini：</strong></p>\n<h3>方法一</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>取得<strong>Oryctini</strong>的<strong>變身代碼平板</strong>並右鍵點擊以獲得代碼。將該代碼輸入到你的<strong>Omnitrix</strong>或<strong>Ultimatrix</strong>中即可添加或移除變身</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a1e796a969a3d430d7437ef00e01ad2ecbca1a8c.png\" alt=\"CodeTablet\"></p>\n<h3>方法二</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>可透過<strong>Mistransformation</strong>解鎖</li>\n</ul>\n<h1><strong>獲取變身代碼</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Machined Soilder</strong>怪物有機率掉落 Galvan 變身代碼</li>\n<li>要在生存模式下獲取除 Galvan 以外的<strong>外星變身</strong>代碼，必須按照以下步驟進行</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>步驟 1 - 獲取 Primus 連結電路</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>攜帶<strong>Omnitrix</strong>或<strong>Ultimatrix</strong>前往墜毀的 Omnitrix 核心飛船。每 1-2 分鐘有機率出現<strong>Volaticus Biopsis</strong>，在外星形態下出現機率會提高。它們死亡時除了掉落其他有用物品外，也有機率掉落<strong>Primus 連結電路</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b78953a6946ff3b0b52e01747178181fda68adc1.png\" alt=\"drone\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c785b1f31ef3002f0310bc460268d8b1bdd7d6c.png\" alt=\"link circuit\"></p>\n<h3><strong>步驟 2 - 獲取不完整代碼平板</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>目前有三種獲取<strong>不完整代碼平板</strong>的方法，第一種是與大師級 Galvan 學家交易</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/61da7479236ba3a4af30c34ca66835e5e37353ba.png\" alt=\"BuyBroken\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>第二種方法是釣魚</li>\n<li>第三種方法是透過 Galvan 戰利品箱獲取</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>步驟 3 - 合成變身代碼平板</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>取得<strong>Primus 連結電路</strong>和<strong>不完整代碼平板</strong>後，變身為<strong>Graymatter</strong>，雙手各持一個物品並右鍵點擊</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c9035d6d342fc4f094f1ac7a428982af45ffbe80.png\" alt=\"hold_crafting\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c33a17f3fffdb54b72c0c5be0e06db5db42450af.png\" alt=\"done_crafting\"></p>\n<h1><strong>即將推出的外星英雄</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ickthyperambuloid (Walkatrout)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Splixson (Ditto)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>更多資訊請參閱 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/YUAyktQNkQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<h1><strong>相依模組</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gravity-api-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">GravityAPI</a>（已打包於此擴充套件中）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252flt2zd42r\" rel=\"nofollow\">Palladium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fumyGl7zF\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f8BmcQJ2H\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252flhGA9TYQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252ft5W7Jfwy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fsk9knFPE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rhino</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fZeVD5ZBy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alien Evolution</a></li>\n</ul>",
